@startuml Sequence_S1_02_Customer_Auth
' US-S1-02 : Inscription / connexion client + profil

title US-S1-02 — Authentification client et profil

actor "Client\n(Angular)" as UI
participant "CustomerAuthController\n/api/auth/customer" as AuthCtrl
participant "MeController\nGET /api/me" as MeCtrl
participant "CustomerAuthService" as AuthSvc
participant "JwtTokenService" as Jwt
database "PostgreSQL\n(EF Core)" as DB

== Inscription ==

UI -> AuthCtrl : POST /api/auth/customer/register\n{ name, email, phone, password }
activate AuthCtrl
AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc : RegisterAsync(dto)
activate AuthSvc
AuthSvc -> DB : SELECT Customer BY email
alt email déjà utilisé
  AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl : 409 Conflict
  AuthCtrl --> UI : erreur
else nouveau client
  AuthSvc -> DB : INSERT Customer\n(PasswordHash = BCrypt)
  AuthSvc -> Jwt : CreateCustomerToken(customerId, email)
  Jwt --> AuthSvc : JWT (role Customer)
  AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl : CustomerAuthResponseDTO\n{ token, customerId }
  AuthCtrl --> UI : 200
  UI -> UI : Stocke JWT\n(localStorage)
end
deactivate AuthSvc
deactivate AuthCtrl

== Connexion ==

UI -> AuthCtrl : POST /api/auth/customer/login\n{ email, password }
activate AuthCtrl
AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc : LoginAsync(dto)
AuthSvc -> DB : SELECT Customer BY email
alt identifiants invalides
  AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl : 401 Unauthorized
  AuthCtrl --> UI : erreur
else OK
  AuthSvc -> AuthSvc : Vérifie PasswordHash
  AuthSvc -> Jwt : CreateCustomerToken(...)
  AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl : CustomerAuthResponseDTO
  AuthCtrl --> UI : 200 + token
end
deactivate AuthCtrl

== Profil (JWT requis) ==

UI -> MeCtrl : GET /api/me\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}
activate MeCtrl
MeCtrl -> MeCtrl : User.GetCustomerId()\n(claim JWT)
MeCtrl -> AuthSvc : GetProfileAsync(customerId)
AuthSvc -> DB : SELECT Customer
AuthSvc --> MeCtrl : CustomerProfileDTO
MeCtrl --> UI : 200 profil
deactivate MeCtrl

note over UI, Jwt
  Intercepteur Angular ajoute le Bearer
  sur /api/me/* et /api/me/cart/*
end note

@enduml
